\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord God the Holy Ghost,
\par In this accepted hour,
\par As on the day of Pentecost,
\par Descend in all Thy power.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. We meet with one accord
\par In our appointed place,
\par And wait the promise of our Lord,
\par The Spirit of all grace.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Like mighty rushing wind 
\par Upon the waves beneath,
\par Move with one impulse every mind,
\par One soul, one feeling breathe,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The young, the old, inspire
\par With wisdom from above;
\par And give us hearts and tongues of fire,
\par To pray and praise and love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Spirit of light explore,
\par And chase our gloom away-
\par With lustre shining more and more,
\par Unto the perfect day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Spirit of truth, be Thou
\par In life and death our guide;
\par O Spirit of adoption, now
\par May we be sanctified.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

